00:07:51,428 --> 00:07:57,428
Gleason is a documentary film directed by J. Clay Tweel.

2
00:15:42,857 --> 00:15:48,857
At the age of 34, former New Orleans Saints defensive back Steve Gleason was
diagnosed with ALS and given a life expectancy of two to five years.

3
00:23:34,285 --> 00:23:40,285
Weeks later, Gleason found out his wife, Michel,
was expecting their first child.

4
00:31:25,714 --> 00:31:31,714
A video journal that began as a gift for his unborn son expands to chronicle Steve’s determination to get his relationships in order, build a foundation to provide other
ALS patients with purpose, and adapt to his declining physical condition—utilizing medical technologies that offer the means to live as fully as possible.

